References: <RM2AIS6m05s.4zmnH8cTCgAJ@knitr.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/knitr/c/RM2AIS6m05s/m/NvErUNdcCgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Woo hoo!

I figured it out at last.  Just in case anyone cares (a set of measure zero!) this is what I have:

title: "Review of Stat I Concepts Part 1"
output: pdf_document
fontsize: 12pt
geometry: margin=1in
documentclass: article
classoption: fleqn

And everything works like a charm!

Thanks,
Erin

